 "remarks": "Welcome to Heights Crossing, Darien's premier luxury apartment community, offering elevated living with unmatched convenience. Ideally located directly across from the Metro-North station, Heights Crossing provides effortless access to New York City while placing residents in the heart of a vibrant coastal town. This newly constructed one-bedroom, one-bath residence blends refined design with modern functionality. The spacious open-concept layout offers flexibility for working, dining and relaxing, with wood-style luxury vinyl tile flooring throughout. The eat-in kitchen features quartz countertops, a seated bar-height island, custom cabinetry, GE appliances and a designer backsplash. Exterior foam insulation enhances peace, privacy and energy efficiency. Community amenities include secure building access, garage parking, an elevator, on-site staffing, a fitness and wellness center, golf simulator, professional office spaces, fireside lounge, rentable event space, bicycle storage, trash chutes and a dedicated mail and package room. Residents also enjoy a landscaped courtyard with a fountain, boutique retail and dining just outside their door, and Darien's beaches and parks only minutes away.",
